{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/258362-npc-personality-quirks-help-me-make-a-table","id":258362,"title":"NPC Personality Quirks - help me make a table!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-16T12:22:01-07:00","id":258362,"title":"NPC Personality Quirks - help me make a table!","content":"Something I find useful when trying to make an NPC distinctive is to give them one obvious character trait that colors everything else they do. I've been thinking it would be handy to make a table of these traits, since I haven't been able to find a good one online - most &quot;trait tables&quot; are for describing physical traits or weird habits which might give a little extra flavor to an NPC, but which probably don't have a meaningful impact on how they interact with other characters. That's not what I want - I want obsessions, passions, and personality disorders that give enough definition to a character that you can build the rest easily after working out a couple background details.<br /> <br /> With that in mind I try to design traits with the following rules:<br /> a. Each trait must be a mental or social trait, not a physical one.<br /> b. Each trait must be general enough to apply to a lot of different characters.<br /> c. Each trait must be expressed in eight words or less.<br /> d. Each trait must <i>not</i> have a mechanical requirement or otherwise impact on character stats.<br /> <br /> Here's 20 to get us started, and I hope you'll add more!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Great Trait Table</b></span><br /> <br /> 1. Enjoys making people uncomfortable.<br /> 2. Very self-conscious about their appearance.<br /> 3. Misogynist (may be self-hating if female)<br /> 4. Misandrist (may be self-hating if male)<br /> 5. Racist against X (may be self-hating if X)<br /> 6. Devoutly religious<br /> 7. Obsessed with sex, dating, or relationships<br /> 8. Seemingly always on drug X.<br /> 9. Total spendthrift.<br /> 10. Total skinflint.<br /> 11. Often tries to be intimidating<br /> 12. Would-be comedian<br /> 13. Married to their job<br /> 14. Very unhappy with their job.<br /> 15. Won't stop talking about one social/political issue<br /> 16. Always ready for a party<br /> 17. Gossips constantly<br /> 18. Really into one or more sports<br /> 19. Very straightforward or blunt<br /> 20. Affects being apathetic about everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":908,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","user":"semicasual","date":". 09-18-2014, 03:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T08:43:04-07:00","id":258995,"title":"","content":"21. Tries to use impressive language<br /> 22. Enjoys music; hums, sings, or plays instrument often<br /> 23. Night Owl OR Early Riser<br /> 24. Complains a lot about trivial things<br /> 25. Very obviously a (pet species) person.<br /> 26. Will take any excuse to tell a story<br /> 27. Wants to hear all of your stories<br /> 28. Really hates another NPC.<br /> 29. Really loves another NPC.<br /> 30. Very competitive attitude<br /> 31. Prone to mood-swings.<br /> 32. Enjoys some visual art (painting, theater, scuplture).<br /> 33. Wants to be &quot;strong&quot; or &quot;tough&quot;<br /> 34. Wants to be &quot;intelligent&quot; or &quot;wise&quot;<br /> 35. Wants to be &quot;respected&quot; or &quot;popular&quot;<br /> 36. Wants to be &quot;anonymous&quot; or &quot;private&quot;<br /> 37. Wants to be &quot;attractive&quot; or &quot;desirable&quot;<br /> 38. Loves modernization, wants &quot;progressive&quot; society<br /> 39. Hates modernization, wants &quot;traditional&quot; socieity<br /> 40. Doesn't like being told what to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":908,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","user":"semicasual","date":". 09-18-2014, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T12:53:41-07:00","id":259976,"title":"","content":"41. Worries a lot about being killed.<br /> 42. Workaholic - always has to be doing something<br /> 43. Has very unusual moral standards for their culture<br /> 44. Has very unusual aesthetic standards for their culture<br /> 45. Dwells in the past<br /> 46. Quickly forgets the past<br /> 47. Really wants some kind of promotion<br /> 48. Very status-conscious<br /> 49. Very wealth-conscious<br /> 50. Exceedingly polite all the time<br /> 51. More hospitable to strangers than neighbors<br /> 52. Wants to build a legacy or legend<br /> 53. Enjoys &quot;exotic&quot; things<br /> 54. Enjoys &quot;local&quot; things<br /> 55. Hates criticism, being corrected<br /> 56. Control freak<br /> 57. Has a Trigger Issue to be tripped<br /> 58. Very particular about making and keeping promises<br /> 59. More methodical than intuitive<br /> 60. More intuitive than methodical","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-17T07:33:47-07:00","id":284940,"title":"","content":"61. Tends to assume the worst about people<br /> 62. Tends to assume the best about people<br /> 63. Consistently defers to other people's authority<br /> 64. Does not respect others' authority<br /> 65. Tells very implausible lies<br /> 66. Has &quot;big plans&quot; for the future<br /> 67. Has no plans for the future<br /> 68. Really holds a grudge<br /> 69, Uses a lot of slang or jargon<br /> 70. Very patriotic<br /> 71. Loves drama, tries to generate it<br /> 72. Hates drama, may be a killjoy<br /> 73. Tactiturn<br /> 74. Vain<br /> 75. Wants to be a better person<br /> 76. Is convinced of their own virtue<br /> 77. Unusually tolerant of different people<br /> 78. Unusually intolerant of different people<br /> 79. Very sensitive about stability and order<br /> 80. Cavalier about causing chaos","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}